@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Edit names or role
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
actor "Administrator" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "AccountFormDialog / AccountForm" as page
  participant "IAccountService / AccountService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "AccountsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "UpdateAccountCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "DesignatedAdministratorPolicy / UserAccount" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  participant "IAuditEventWriter" as audit
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
== Open: the form reads its account ==
actor -> page : Choose Edit on a row or the details page
page -> client : accountResource(GetAccountQuery { id }); the fields and Save changes stay disabled while it loads (edit-loading)
client -> access : GET /api/accounts/{id}, with the checks and handler of Read account details
access --> client : 200 AccountDetail, 404, or a failure
alt Account read
  client --> page : The draft starts from the resolved values; the fields and Save changes enabled (edit)
else Read failed: 500 or no response
  client --> page : load-failed: alert with Try again (reload()), plus the reference ID when a 500 carried one; Cancel closes; the fields and Save changes stay disabled (edit-load-failed)
else 404
  client --> page : Form emits notFound; the dialog closes with NotFound; the owning page increments its counter: the details page shows its not-found state with Back to accounts, and the directory rereads and shows the "Account not found" toast
end
== Submit ==
actor -> page : Change names or role and save
page -> page : Disable repeat submission; show saving progress
page -> client : update(UpdateAccountCommand: names, role, expectedVersion; email only if a caller sends one)
client -> access : PUT /api/accounts/{id}
alt No response: the connection dropped or the request timed out
  client --> page : update() rejects with a no-response error; the edit may or may not have been saved
  page -> page : failed presentation with "We couldn't confirm whether your changes were saved"; keep the edits and the version the form opened; no reference ID; DraftState.unconfirmed until the next answered save
  page -> page : AccountForm emits unconfirmed, which the dialog relays while it stays open; the owning page increments its counter at once, so the page behind rereads and shows whether the change is there
  page --> actor : Save changes resends only when chosen, with the version the form opened: if the first save committed, the repeat meets the stale 409 below, whose comparison is headed "The latest saved version is shown beside your entries" and never says "Your edits haven't been saved"
else Response received
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry (zero clock skew)
access -> db : LoadAccountAccessAsync: current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; inactive or missing account; credential version changed
  access -> audit : AppendRestrictedAsync(Denied); no payload
  access --> client : 401
  client --> page : sessionInterceptor: end(Unauthorized) once for this generation; the promise rejects with its 401, so nothing was written; login opens (session-unsaved)
else Authenticated Collaborator (profile P: no accounts.manage)
  access -> audit : AppendRestrictedAsync(Denied); no payload
  access --> client : 403
  client --> page : refreshCapabilities() (deduplicated); AccountForm emits forbidden; the dialog closes with Forbidden and the owning page calls showStatus(AccessDenied); nothing saved
else Administrator
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send UpdateAccountCommand through MediatR 12.5.0
  validation -> validation : L2-004 trim names (1-100), known role, email syntax if present
  alt Invalid request
    validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; no business mutation
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Keep valid input; one field error moves focus to that field, which reads its error; several move focus to the linked error summary; no Retry or reference ID
  else Valid request
    validation -> handler : Handle UpdateAccountCommand
    handler -> db : Load account by ID
    db --> handler : Current account or none
    alt Account missing
      handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing changed
      ctrl --> client : NotFound ProblemDetails
      client --> page : Form emits notFound; the dialog closes with NotFound; the owning page increments its counter: the details page shows its not-found state with Back to accounts, and the directory shows the "Account not found" toast
    else Account found
      handler -> entity : L2-008 (email, demotion, deactivation); proposed name lock -> 409
      entity --> handler : Designated: email, names (proposed lock) or role differ; any account: normalized email differs (proposed)
      alt Protected identity change
        handler -> audit : AppendRestrictedAsync(Rejected), outside any business transaction (L2-039.2)
        audit -> db : Insert audit event only
        handler --> ctrl : 409 protected-identity with explanation; account unchanged
        ctrl --> client : Conflict ProblemDetails (protected-identity)
        client --> page : Show the explanation in the alert region; keep input; no retry offered; emit outdated, so closing returns Outdated
      else Stored version differs from expectedVersion
        handler --> ctrl : 409 stale version; nothing changed
        ctrl --> client : Conflict ProblemDetails (stale)
        client --> page : Promise rejects with the stale 409
        page -> client : AccountForm emits outdated and calls reload() on its accountResource once (GET /api/accounts/{id}, authorized as above)
        client --> page : Latest saved values and version
        page --> actor : conflict state: keep attempted values; show Your edit vs Latest saved; no resubmission; after an unconfirmed save the alert is headed "The latest saved version is shown beside your entries" instead of saying "Your edits haven't been saved"
        note right of page
          L2-041.3: Reload latest adopts the latest values and
          version without a request (conflict-reloaded); the
          comparison stays visible until edits are re-applied and saved.
        end note
      else Permitted change at current version
        handler -> entity : L2-004 apply names and role
        entity --> handler : Updated account
        handler -> db : L2-039 / L2-040 AddAuditEvent(success); SaveChangesAsync updates where version matches and commits both
        alt Racing save changed the version
          db --> handler : 0 rows; roll back update and audit
          handler --> ctrl : 409 stale version, handled as above
          ctrl --> client : Conflict ProblemDetails (stale)
          client --> page : Same handling as the stale branch above
        else Commit fails unexpectedly
          db --> handler : Roll back business state and success audit
          handler --> ctrl : Generic 500 with correlation ID
          ctrl --> client : Failure; no successful-save claim
          client --> page : failed: nothing changed; keep input; show reference ID; Save changes retries
        else Commit succeeds
          db --> handler : New committed version
          handler --> ctrl : 200 with safe account summary and version
          ctrl --> client : Success response
          client --> page : Form emits draftChange (clean) and saved; the dialog closes with Saved(account); the owning page increments its counter, so its view rereads, and shows the "Changes saved" toast naming the account
          page --> actor : Role change applies on that account's next request (L2-004.3)
        end
      end
    end
  end
end
end
note over ctrl, db
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
